<p>NOTE: The Company incurred a net loss of ($626,000) or ($.07) per share excluding non-recurring charges of ($874,000) or ($.09) per share for the quarter, compared to a net loss of ($10,999,000) or ($1.21) per share that included charges of ($6,695,000) or ($.73) per share in the comparable quarter ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Non-recurring charges in the fourth quarter ended December 31, 1996 are a result of severance charges due to changes in senior management.</p>
